t: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This systematic documentation mitigates potential financial disputes and ensures full regulatory adherence, creating an immutable audit trail that protects both the logistics provider and the client from fraudulent claims or regulatory penalties during inter-state movements.</span></li></ul><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
