    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">FASTag Deactivation Protocol:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Physically remove or disable the FASTag device before departure to prevent automatic toll collection against the carrier’s RFID account. Retain a photographic record of the disabled status to provide definitive proof of intent to pay cash or use alternative payment methods.</p>
